<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hertz Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hertz Corp cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers cut its rating for car rental company Hertz Corp Friday to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Since April 26, the stock has risen 51 percent from its IPO price of $24 ... to its current price of 36-1/4.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We currently believe that from the current point, the price of the equity will appreciate more in line with our estimated growth rate for EPS of 21 percent.&quot;</p>
<p>-- &quot;... There is no change in our estimates, which we continue to believe will prove conservative.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company fell 3/8 to 35-7/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
